    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ophir</span></b> , indecl. (= ), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a region in Southern
				Arabia</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 3 Reg. 9, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. 1 Par.
				29, 4</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ophirius</span></b> , a, um, <i>of</i>
			or <i>from Ophir</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 36,
				26, 66, § 193</span></i>.</div>
